.net/en/artworks/84066275\nhttps://www.pixiv.net/en/artworks/94260220\n\n水着姿でも普段着でも、自由に描いてください。\nおさかべ姫のキャラクター参考資料です。\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1IbMcaALO0IheFhkI4aOsvpJtNYQHtFIt?usp=share_link\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1PYeEud1kIaTFMz5dvm9fVZDbfFfviHs4?usp=share_link\n\n可能であれば、背景を透明にしてプレイボーイだけの画像もお願いします。", "nc": 177, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@Ferncrab/works/7", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 7760, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/a1defe7a/uploads/origins/25dea18c-e94b-48f6-8f89-96bc4dfd10d2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=23ac1bbf086c8208e63b83d471ac832e", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a1defe7a/uploads/origins/25dea18c-e94b-48f6-8f89-96bc4dfd10d2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=23ac1bbf086c8208e63b83d471ac832e, https://si.imgix.net/a1defe7a/uploads/origins/25dea18c-e94b-48f6-8f89-96bc4dfd10d2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e8b34ae51fcfef277e07e48ca969475c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a1defe7a/uploads/origins/25dea18c-e94b-48f6-8f89-96bc4dfd10d2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d330c85399fe71f6282cd8dde941ff02 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": true, "hardcore": true, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/a1defe7a/uploads/origins/25dea18c-e94b-48f6-8f89-96bc4dfd10d2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=87cb0bd85b1a4e9ceaafb8c61afcdc35", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a1defe7a/uploads/origins/25dea18c-e94b-48f6-8f89-96bc4dfd10d2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=87cb0bd85b1a4e9ceaafb8c61afcdc35, https://si.imgix.net/a1defe7a/uploads/origins/25dea18c-e94b-48f6-8f89-96bc4dfd10d2?bg=%23ff